potrace: potrace (convert bitmaps into vector graphics)
potrace:
potrace: Potrace is a tool for transforming a bitmap into a smooth, scalable
potrace: image. The input is a bitmap (PBM, PGM, PPM, or BMP), and the output
potrace: is one of several vector file formats. The resulting image is not
potrace: "jaggy" like a bitmap, but smooth. It can then be rendered at any
potrace: resolution.
